  {
    "Name": "Kinetic Synthesis",
    "Description": "Dealing Kinetic Weapon Damage and scoring Kinetic Weapon Kills progress a counter, spawning an unique Kinetic Ammo Brick upon reaching 100%.\nCounter lasts 15s and is refreshed upon dealing Kinetic Weapon Damage.\n\nEach damage point grants 0.0265% progress, requiring 3770 damage to spawn a brick.\nRnF Kill = 8% | Elite = 15% | Miniboss = 25%\nDamage requirement IGNORES Power-Delta, but considers ACTUAL DAMAGE DEALT.\nThis means it requires the same \"hits\" regardless of delta.\n\nUpon collecting a Kinetic Ammo Brick:\nRefills equipped Kinetic Damage Weapons and generates Special/Power Ammo.\n5% Special and 5% Heavy Ammo Progress.\n\nKinetic Ammo Generation is unaffected by Scavenger Bricks.\nGenerates 33% of Magazine, rounded up, with certain exceptions.\nCounts for Ammo Pickup effects.\n\nBastion = +1 Ammo | Microcosm = +24 Ammo.\nNo Land Beyond can spawn an Ammo Brick but does not receive ammo.",
    "hash": "193266679",
    "parentHash": "2894222926",
    "parentName": "Implement of Curiosity",
    "tierIndex": 2,
    "tierTitle": "Tier 3",
    "descriptions": {
